<title>UK: BGB Finance sets 100 mln rand one-year bond.</title>
<headline>BGB Finance sets 100 mln rand one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE (IRELAND) PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN GROUP</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     15.75     MATURITY 12.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE 12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/IE/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ  YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM 0.10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STANDARD</p>
<p>   NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
